<http://data.silknow.org/object/6cfff3f4-5b75-3e01-ab3c-3ce251bece60>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Half-length portrait of the king facing to the left within an oval. He has long hair, a moustache and beard, and wears a wide-brimmed hat, a lace collar and a cloak emblazoned on the left shoulder with the star of the Order of Garter. Behind him is a landscape showing the Lambeth marshes, the Thames and, on the far bank, Westminster Abbey, Parliament Buildings, Whitehall and the new Banqueting House."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/3e4f6e12-8e87-3f37-b2d4-e435fffbf465> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/e55a701a-771b-3eab-bfa1-657e318a2536> ;
